    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d143">

                <pb facs="0270" n="158" xml:id="pg158"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/2003</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-13T20:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 13, 1918, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram September 9, 6 p.m. The conclusion of a loan in connection with the
                    scheme of currency notes is denied by the Minister of Finance but the truth of
                    the matter is nevertheless in doubt.</p>
                <p>So far as can be learned the enforcement of the gold regulations is in abeyance
                    for time being but while the ultimate intentions of the authorities cannot be
                    known, it is not supposed that they have definitely abandoned the project.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
